{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54613","headline":"兵要望江南 占雨第八（京本列第二○十七首） 十一 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占雨第八（京本列第二○十七首） 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天雨蛩，在敌不能（辛本作「宜」）攻。\n或鳖或鱼皆凶（首本作「吉」，今从辛本）兆，我军见者便回程，不动必遭凶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54613.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54613","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}